# Dockerfile-specific ignore rules apply to the shared two-repository context.
# Keep this beside Dockerfile; use the Dockerfile path in the deployment guide.
*
!Daisy_form/
!Daisy_form/**
!Daisy_form_backend/
!Daisy_form_backend/**
**/.git
**/.hg
**/.svn
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/*.env.example
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.gnupg
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/data
**/backup
**/backups
**/.daisy-backup-*
**/*inquiries*.json
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*-wal
**/*-shm
**/*-journal
**/*.log
**/logs
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/test
**/tests
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.cache
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/tmp
**/temp
**/scratch
**/release
**/releases
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tgz
**/*.gz
**/*.bz2
**/*.xz
**/*.7z
**/*.rar
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/__MACOSX
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
